@bank all
// ZW1 (writer), patch 0.92.5 item 10: the redone birthday. The birthday person sits at a table with a cake; a group
// circles round and says these in speech bubbles; you can tap the cake for a slice. For the events builder to wire.
// Kinds. The bubble kinds go through lineFor(speaker, kind, ctx), so a person's own lines of the same kind win over these;
// the TEXT kinds (bday.slice*) are said by nobody: read LINES[kind] directly (like the clothes tips), one at random.
//   bday.circle      a crew member in the circle, to the birthday person (a crew member). Bubble, 60 chars or fewer.
//                    {other} = the birthday person's name: pass ctx.other = their crew id. Lines without {other} work too.
//   bday.circle.you  the same, when the birthday person is you. {me} = your name. Bubble.
//   bday.thanks      the birthday person (crew), thanking the circle. Bubble. Say one or two, at the end.
//   bday.slice       TEXT (a toast, not a bubble), when you tap the cake and take a slice. 90 chars or fewer.
//   bday.slice.you   TEXT, the same at your own party.
// Own lines (same kinds) are in content/lines/ for Zeke, Brennan, Calder, Holt, Pell, Rina, Tomas, Kovac, Marrow and
// Vance. Pick a different line for each person in the circle (the no-repeat FX13 builds, or LINE_RECENT does it).

== bday.circle
- Happy birthday, {other}!
- Happy birthday! Make a wish. A big one.
- Many happy returns, {other}.
- Happy birthday! Cake first, speeches never.   #funny
- Here's to you, {other}. Happy birthday.   #warm
- Happy birthday! You don't look a day older.   #funny
- Another year round the sun. Well, round a lot of suns.   #funny
- Happy birthday, {other}. The ship's lucky to have you.   #warm
- Blow them out! All of them! In one go!
- Happy birthday! Who made the cake? It's perfect.
- Cheers, {other}. Have a lovely day.   #warm
- Happy birthday! Go on, cut it. We're all waiting.   #funny
- Many happy returns! Save me a corner piece.   #funny
- Happy birthday, {other}. You make this place better.   #warm
- Hip hip! Come on, everyone. Hip hip!
- Happy birthday! You've earned a day off. Nearly.   #funny
- To {other}! Happy birthday!
- Happy birthday. I brought my appetite. And good wishes.   #funny
- Happy birthday, {other}. Thanks for all the help this year.   #warm
- A whole cake, just for you. Well. For us. For you.   #funny
- Happy birthday! Did you make a wish? Don't tell us.
- Happy birthday, {other}. Have the biggest slice.   #warm
- Happy birthday! I'd sing, but nobody wants that.   #funny
- Here's to many more, {other}. Happy birthday.   #warm
- Happy birthday! Look at that cake. Look at it.
- Happy birthday! The best thing about today is you.   #warm
- Happy birthday, {other}. Mind the candles.   #funny
- Happy birthday! I wrote you a card. It's mostly stars.   #warm
- Happy birthday! Another year of putting up with us.   #funny
- Many happy returns, {other}. Truly.   #warm
- Happy birthday! Speech! Speech! No? Fair enough.   #funny
- Happy birthday, {other}. Enjoy every crumb.
- Happy birthday! You're the best kind of crewmate.   #warm
- Happy birthday! Somebody find a candle that's still lit.   #funny
- Happy birthday, {other}. Same time next year?   #warm
- Happy birthday! Who's counting candles? Not me.   #funny
- Happy birthday! I've been looking forward to this all week.
- Happy birthday, {other}. Here's to a smooth year.   #warm
- Happy birthday! Cut it, cut it, cut it!   #funny
- Happy birthday, {other}. We'd be lost without you.   #warm
- Happy birthday! It smells amazing. The cake, I mean.   #funny
- Happy birthday, {other}! Best day of the week.
- Happy birthday! A wish, a slice, and a nap.   #funny
- Happy birthday, {other}. You deserve a fuss. So: fuss.   #warm

== bday.circle.you
- Happy birthday, {me}!
- Happy birthday, {me}! Make a wish.   #warm
- Happy birthday, new hand! Your first one aboard?   #warm
- Many happy returns, {me}!
- Happy birthday, {me}! Speech! Kidding. Cake!   #funny
- Happy birthday! You've fitted right in, {me}.   #warm
- Happy birthday, {me}. Glad you're one of us.   #warm
- Blow them out, {me}! All of them!
- Happy birthday! First slice is yours, {me}.
- Happy birthday, {me}! The whole ship knows, sorry.   #funny
- To {me}! Happy birthday!
- Happy birthday, {me}. Here's to your first year.   #warm

== bday.thanks
- Thank you, all of you. Really.   #warm
- Oh, stop it. No, don't stop. Thank you.   #funny
- You lot. Thank you. This is lovely.   #warm
- Thank you! Now, who wants the first slice?
- Thank you. I didn't want a fuss. I loved the fuss.   #funny
- Thanks, everyone. Best birthday in a long while.   #warm
- Thank you! I'm not making a speech. Thank you, though.   #funny
- Cake for everyone. That's my thank-you.
- Thank you. I'll remember this one.   #warm
- You're all very kind. Now eat. Please.   #funny

== bday.slice
- You take a slice. It's soft, sweet and still a little warm.
- A slice of birthday cake, on a little plate. It's very good.
- You cut yourself a slice. Someone's already eyeing the last corner.
- You take a slice of cake. Thick icing, light sponge. Lovely.
- A slice for you. The candle smoke still hangs over the table.
- You take a slice and a napkin. Somebody cheers, for no reason.

== bday.slice.you
- You cut the first slice of your own cake. Everyone cheers.
- Your birthday cake, your slice. It tastes even better for that.
- You take a slice of your cake. The circle cheers you on.
